{"shortDescription":"By Avinash  PLatin American assets were mixed on Friday and remained on track for weekly losses, while the presidential race in the region's largest economy, Brazil intensified and investors monitored trade talks between Mexico and the US.In Brazil, President Luiz Inacio Lula da Silva held a narrow…","astDescription":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"p","children":["By Avinash  P"]},{"type":"p","children":["Latin American assets were mixed on Friday and remained on track for weekly losses, while the presidential race in the region's largest economy, Brazil intensified and investors monitored trade talks between Mexico and the US."]},{"type":"p","children":["In Brazil, President Luiz Inacio Lula da Silva held a narrow numerical lead over Senator Flavio Bolsonaro in a potential runoff in the October presidential election, according to a Datafolha poll published on Thursday."]},{"type":"p","children":["In the runoff scenario, Lula had 46% support and Flavio Bolsonaro, had 44%, unchanged from the previous poll."]},{"type":"p","children":["Markets have closely monitored the shift in electoral surveys, and a Lula victory could add to investor anxiety the worsening public finances under the current administration."]},{"type":"p","children":["Local stocks benchmark ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"BMFBOVESPA:IBOV","text":"BMFBOVESPA:IBOV"}}," fell 0.7% and on track for a first weekly loss in five as uncertainty over the presidential elections weighed. The real ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"FX_IDC:USDBRL","text":"FX_IDC:USDBRL"}}," dropped 0.7% to 5.1644 a dollar."]},{"type":"p","children":["The broader LatAm stocks gauge (.MILA00000PUS) fell 0.8% and also on track to a weekly loss."]},{"type":"p","children":["The US dollar reminded firm at multi week highs it touched after a widely expected rate hike by the Federal Reserve on Wednesday, pressuring regional currencies."]},{"type":"p","children":["MSCI's LatAm FX (.MILA00000CUS) was down 